Скопіюйте цей код і вставте у файл **`README.md`**:

```markdown
# 🚘 Vehicle Import Cost Calculator App — Business Analysis Case Study

**Author:** Danilo Andrijašević (Business Analyst / Operations)  
**Status:** Complete  
**Tech Stack / Tools:** Python (Flask), SQLite, BPMN (Mermaid), Markdown, Git

---

## 📌 Executive Summary
Currently, import managers spend **up to several hours** performing manual cost calculations across disconnected Excel files and external customs schedules. 

The **Vehicle Import Cost Calculator App** automates customs clearance, excise duty, VAT, and logistics estimates, cutting quote generation time to **under 2 seconds** with 0% calculation error rate.

---

## 📁 Repository Structure & Documentation

This repository contains full end-to-end Business Analysis & Functional Documentation:

| Document | Description | Key Focus Areas |
| :--- | :--- | :--- |
| **[📄 BRD.md](./BRD.md)** | Business Requirements Document | Problem statement, SMART objectives, Stakeholder Matrix, Core Calculation Engine |
| **[📄 FRD_NFR.md](./FRD_NFR.md)** | Functional & Non-Functional Requirements | User Stories (Gherkin format), Acceptance Criteria, Performance & Security NFRs, RTM |
| **[📄 Process_Modeling.md](./Process_Modeling.md)** | Process Workflows | As-Is vs To-Be process models (Mermaid BPMN diagrams), Gap Analysis |
| **[📄 Technical_Artifacts.md](./Technical_Artifacts.md)** | Technical Design & Data Architecture | SQLite Schema (DDL), Core Python calculation logic, SQL analytical queries |

---

## 🎯 Key Project Highlights & Results

- **99% Cycle Time Reduction:** Reduced quote generation time from hours to < 2 seconds.
- **Data Standardization:** Replaced unmanaged Excel sheets with a relational SQLite schema.
- **Full Traceability:** Requirements mapped directly from Business Objectives to User Stories and NFRs via RTM.
- **Audit-Ready:** Automated generation of unique UUIDs and timestamps for every calculation.

```
